WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:39.010
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.280 --> 01:41.520
[Episode 11]

3
01:59.760 --> 02:02.000
Yu Chang Xuan, are you insane?

4
02:02.000 --> 02:03.640
Exciting, isn't it?

5
02:05.920 --> 02:07.460
You're right.

6
02:09.019 --> 02:13.560
We don't need to tell Secretary Jiang about us.

7
02:22.000 --> 02:25.520
If you don't say anything, and I don't say anything,

8
02:27.180 --> 02:30.419
we can keep this a secret.

9
02:35.400 --> 02:38.200
You are absolutely shameless.

10
02:55.280 --> 02:56.837
Ping Jun.

11
02:56.837 --> 02:58.740
Want me to get the door?

12
02:59.600 --> 03:00.893
Ping Jun.

13
03:27.160 --> 03:28.866
That's more like it.

14
03:35.160 --> 03:38.519
I have all kinds of birds at home, you know.

15
03:40.440 --> 03:45.240
They chirp all day, never stopping.

16
03:46.120 --> 03:51.500
But my favorites are still canaries.

17
03:53.480 --> 03:58.386
They're quiet and obedient.

18
04:18.880 --> 04:20.453
Yu Chang Xuan.

19
04:22.720 --> 04:25.060
What do you want?

20
04:26.400 --> 04:27.760
Kiss me.

21
04:38.120 --> 04:39.600
Don't cry.

22
04:42.960 --> 04:48.080
If I don't cry, will you let me go?

23
04:51.660 --> 04:52.920
No.

24
04:55.520 --> 04:56.886
Ye Ping Jun.

25
04:59.360 --> 05:01.093
As long as you say yes,

26
05:01.960 --> 05:07.480
everything in Nanhuai City...

27
05:10.000 --> 05:12.160
will be yours from now on.

28
05:19.280 --> 05:20.906
Yu Chang Xuan.

29
05:22.920 --> 05:24.920
Listen to me carefully.

30
05:26.880 --> 05:30.540
I won't consider any of your insane demands.

31
05:32.200 --> 05:34.000
In this lifetime,

32
05:35.360 --> 05:39.613
I don't want anything to do with a despicable man like you.

33
05:41.439 --> 05:44.100
Because I hated you from the start.

34
05:45.100 --> 05:46.439
I hate you.

35
06:49.640 --> 06:50.764
Corps Commander.

36
06:50.764 --> 06:52.200
Secretary Jiang.

37
06:52.200 --> 06:53.566
What are you doing here?

38
06:54.180 --> 06:55.379
I'm looking for Ping Jun.

39
06:55.379 --> 06:58.139
She said she needed to clean her dress.

40
07:00.680 --> 07:01.973
By the way,

41
07:03.640 --> 07:05.920
I just found an earring.

42
07:05.920 --> 07:09.533
Looks like it belongs to Miss Ye.

43
07:13.600 --> 07:15.093
Please return it to her for me.

44
07:23.560 --> 07:24.839
Don't mention it.

45
07:25.800 --> 07:31.560
What matters most to a woman is that she can count on him.

46
07:32.240 --> 07:34.240
You shouldn't just love her.

47
07:34.240 --> 07:37.526
You need to be able to protect her.

48
07:39.960 --> 07:44.160
Secretary Jiang, work hard and make something of yourself.

49
07:44.160 --> 07:49.986
Don't let another man lay a hand on your girlfriend again.

50
07:55.000 --> 07:57.053
Thank you for the advice.

51
08:31.240 --> 08:32.760
Secretary Jiang.

52
08:32.760 --> 08:34.880
Didn't she tell you she knows me?

53
08:34.880 --> 08:38.385
Weren't you afraid someone would steal away such a wonderful girlfriend?

54
08:38.385 --> 08:42.606
At the Officers' Club ball this Saturday, remember to bring a date.

55
08:43.273 --> 08:44.360
Turn right at the next intersection.

56
08:44.360 --> 08:45.700
I know.

57
08:46.520 --> 08:49.384
She looks so much like an old friend of mine.

58
08:49.384 --> 08:52.039
Many people in this world look alike.

59
08:52.039 --> 08:55.240
Advisor Yang, please don't take it to heart.

60
08:56.840 --> 09:01.106
What matters most to a woman is that she can count on him.

61
09:01.106 --> 09:06.826
Don't let another man lay a hand on your girlfriend again.

62
09:27.984 --> 09:31.488
[Military Vehicle Records]

63
09:39.760 --> 09:42.057
You really are enviable.

64
09:42.057 --> 09:45.120
You're always surrounded by life and beautiful things.

65
09:45.120 --> 09:46.640
You brat.

66
09:46.640 --> 09:48.910
Looks to me like you're riding high.

67
09:48.910 --> 09:51.380
The moment you get home, you start making jokes at my expense.

68
09:52.240 --> 09:53.919
I heard about it.

69
09:53.919 --> 09:56.680
You actually got Advisor Yang to back you up.

70
09:56.680 --> 10:00.117
That must have reassured the arms dealers and the banks.

71
10:00.117 --> 10:02.519
With the Tao family's full support,

72
10:03.760 --> 10:09.520
I'd say you've had the arsenal project well in hand from the start.

73
10:09.520 --> 10:11.520
That's you, all right.

74
10:11.520 --> 10:15.400
Even buried in your garden, you're still remarkably well-informed.

75
10:16.272 --> 10:18.560
Nothing is guaranteed to succeed.

76
10:18.560 --> 10:21.760
I'm just used to keeping more than one option open.

77
10:22.480 --> 10:24.921
Enough about that. Come look at my flowers.

78
10:26.440 --> 10:28.040
These are begonias.

79
10:28.040 --> 10:29.360
These are kerria flowers.

80
10:29.360 --> 10:30.800
These are yellow roses.

81
10:30.800 --> 10:33.544
They both go well with lilacs.

82
10:33.544 --> 10:35.853
They make the lilacs look even more elegant.

83
10:37.080 --> 10:41.560
Even when you plant flowers, you give the lilacs center stage.

84
11:05.040 --> 11:06.520
Those are plantain lilies.

85
11:06.520 --> 11:08.320
They're the cleanest and purest of all.

86
11:08.320 --> 11:10.933
They have a crystal-clear innocence about them.

87
11:10.933 --> 11:13.926
If you like them, I'll move one out for you to keep.

88
11:15.440 --> 11:19.650
Forget it. I've never been good with flowers.

89
11:19.650 --> 11:24.120
And I wouldn't know how to care for lilies.

90
11:24.120 --> 11:26.039
Tending flowers is like loving someone.

91
11:26.039 --> 11:28.520
You have to understand their nature.

92
11:28.520 --> 11:32.640
Give them exactly the sunlight and rain they need.

93
11:33.879 --> 11:37.279
Not a bit more, not a bit less.

94
11:50.860 --> 11:55.240
Yu Chang Xuan, listen to me carefully.

95
11:55.240 --> 11:57.039
In this lifetime,

96
11:58.720 --> 12:03.139
I don't want anything to do with a despicable man like you.

97
12:10.360 --> 12:13.252
[Nanhuai Orphanage] Here. This one's for you.

98
12:13.252 --> 12:15.240
This one's for you.

99
12:15.240 --> 12:17.160
Thank you, Sister Ping Jun.

100
12:17.160 --> 12:18.640
Go play.

101
12:21.379 --> 12:24.160
Ping Jun, you bought the children so many books again.

102
12:24.160 --> 12:26.807
You've spent far too much on them.

103
12:26.807 --> 12:30.886
Seeing them this happy makes it all worth it.

104
12:32.400 --> 12:34.193
By the way, did you hear?

105
12:34.193 --> 12:38.119
Nanhuai merchants announced there'll be no discrimination against refugees.

106
12:38.119 --> 12:41.600
Without household registration, they could only work temporary jobs before.

107
12:41.600 --> 12:44.200
Now the longest contracts can be extended to a year.

108
12:44.993 --> 12:46.960
The household registration office will issue a notice soon.

109
12:46.960 --> 12:52.760
One can apply for residency if they work here for five years, obey the law, and behave well.

110
12:52.760 --> 12:53.840
Yes.

111
12:53.840 --> 12:58.280
Thanks to Master Chang Xuan working behind the scenes, city hall finally relented.

112
13:04.160 --> 13:05.560
What's wrong?

113
13:05.560 --> 13:07.133
What are you thinking about?

114
13:09.000 --> 13:10.680
Nothing.

115
13:10.680 --> 13:13.440
By the way, where's Mu?

116
13:13.440 --> 13:15.276
He's usually the liveliest one.

117
13:15.276 --> 13:17.276
Why haven't I seen him today?

118
13:17.840 --> 13:20.680
He's in the backyard, sulking.

119
13:22.540 --> 13:24.300
What's wrong with him?

120
13:25.600 --> 13:27.560
Today is Mu's birthday.

121
13:28.246 --> 13:32.880
When his parents were alive, they always made a big day of it.

122
13:32.880 --> 13:34.379
But now...

123
13:37.240 --> 13:40.320
The first round of funding will officially go into building the arsenal.

124
13:41.040 --> 13:43.879
The gun assembly shop and ammunition shop will be in Sandaogou.

125
13:43.879 --> 13:45.600
The repair shop will be in Baijiagou.

126
13:45.600 --> 13:48.500
They are all in the most hidden, defensible parts of Mount Changping.

127
13:49.160 --> 13:50.360
Keep a close eye on the schedule.

128
13:50.360 --> 13:52.880
Make sure the new technicians get generous compensation.

129
13:52.880 --> 13:54.360
Have our people learn as fast as they can.

130
13:54.360 --> 13:57.580
We need to make our own guns and cannons. We can't always rely on foreigners.

131
13:57.580 --> 13:59.340
- I need to trouble you with one more thing. - No need to be so polite.

132
13:59.340 --> 14:01.320
If there is a problem, I can help.

133
14:01.320 --> 14:05.810
At five this afternoon, Ping Jun and I are celebrating the orphanage kids' birthdays.

134
14:05.810 --> 14:07.240
We are going to the temple fair together too.

135
14:07.240 --> 14:10.680
So I'll need you to translate these documents for me.

136
14:10.680 --> 14:13.284
No problem. When I finish translating them, I'll file them for you.

137
14:13.284 --> 14:14.937
Thank you, Ying Mei.

138
14:24.600 --> 14:26.329
Xue Ting. Don't leave yet.

139
14:26.329 --> 14:28.280
You need to work late tonight.

140
14:28.280 --> 14:30.720
Group Leader, I have plans tonight.

141
14:30.720 --> 14:33.080
These are the new source documents for the carbine.

142
14:33.080 --> 14:34.603
The Technical Department needs them urgently.

143
14:34.603 --> 14:37.017
You must finish translating all of them tonight.

144
14:37.017 --> 14:38.280
Take a look.

145
14:38.280 --> 14:40.040
Sorry. Thanks for taking this on.

146
14:40.040 --> 14:41.146
Group Leader.

147
14:41.146 --> 14:44.490
Then I'd like to access some files in the archive room tonight.

148
14:44.490 --> 14:46.669
No problem. I'll approve a pass for you.

149
14:52.320 --> 14:53.820
What terrible timing.

150
14:54.520 --> 14:55.640
Ying Mei.

151
14:55.640 --> 14:58.990
After you finish translating, go to the temple fair and tell Ping Jun for me.

152
14:58.990 --> 15:00.879
Sure. Don't worry.

153
15:11.760 --> 15:13.600
He got called in to work late?

154
15:13.600 --> 15:15.840
The Group Leader kept him there. He really couldn't get out of it.

155
15:15.840 --> 15:17.693
Xue Ting asked me to come right away and let you know.

156
15:18.720 --> 15:20.630
Okay. I understand. Thanks for doing this.

157
15:20.630 --> 15:23.324
No need. I delivered the message, so I'll head back now.

158
15:23.324 --> 15:25.019
- Thanks. - No problem.

159
15:28.440 --> 15:31.640
Come on. I'll take you inside. Let's go.

160
15:31.640 --> 15:33.619
Let's go.

161
15:38.560 --> 15:39.793
Mu.

162
15:43.320 --> 15:45.600
Brother Chang Xuan.

163
15:45.600 --> 15:48.239
Happy birthday, Mu.

164
15:52.320 --> 15:53.893
What are you doing here?

165
15:54.740 --> 15:56.845
Mu asked me to spend his birthday with him.

166
15:58.000 --> 15:59.980
- Right, Mu? - Yes.

167
16:01.760 --> 16:03.670
Let's go celebrate your birthday.

168
16:03.670 --> 16:06.583
You're busy with official business. I'll stay with Mu.

169
16:06.583 --> 16:08.206
You should go.

170
16:10.040 --> 16:13.140
Why should I leave? I didn't come for you.

171
16:55.560 --> 16:56.690
Sir, madam.

172
16:56.690 --> 16:58.360
See if there are any stories you like.

173
16:58.360 --> 17:00.100
If there are, try making the leads as clay figures.

174
17:00.100 --> 17:02.293
If they look alike, you get a prize.

175
17:03.625 --> 17:06.226
Sister Ping Jun, I want that little wooden horse.

176
17:09.560 --> 17:11.560
You want that little wooden horse?

177
17:14.040 --> 17:16.679
Join in. It is his birthday, after all.

178
17:24.960 --> 17:26.266
Fine.

179
18:10.400 --> 18:12.800
Well? Looks just like him, right?

180
18:13.760 --> 18:16.080
That doesn't look like Liang Shan Bo.

181
18:16.080 --> 18:18.840
It looks like the unreasonable Ma Wen Cai.

182
18:18.840 --> 18:20.546
What is wrong with Ma Wen Cai?

183
18:21.360 --> 18:24.520
I think Liang Shan Bo is the weak one.

184
18:30.500 --> 18:34.880
When you like a girl, you should go after her.

185
18:41.200 --> 18:42.539
Miss Zhu.

186
18:43.400 --> 18:47.640
I hear you and Liang Shan Bo pledged yourselves to each other first.

187
18:49.600 --> 18:51.200
Stop fooling around.

188
18:53.960 --> 18:58.273
Good things in this world must be fought for.

189
18:59.000 --> 19:03.040
If I don't fight, how do I know it isn't mine?

190
19:03.040 --> 19:07.040
If I don't try to take it, how do I know I can't?

191
19:09.480 --> 19:10.839
Mr. Ma.

192
19:11.600 --> 19:15.483
Feelings have to be mutual.

193
19:15.483 --> 19:17.013
You can't force them.

194
19:21.840 --> 19:23.686
Not only will I force them,

195
19:24.320 --> 19:26.086
I'll fight for them.

196
19:31.560 --> 19:33.147
Ying Tai.

197
19:33.147 --> 19:35.760
If I could walk you those 18 miles,

198
19:35.760 --> 19:38.432
I'd stay by your side every step.

199
19:38.432 --> 19:43.353
I would never let you have the chance to be promised to someone else.

200
19:46.880 --> 19:48.946
- Mu, it's late. I'll take you home. - Watch out!

201
21:33.680 --> 21:35.021
Mr. Ma.

202
21:35.880 --> 21:39.800
Feelings have to be mutual.

203
21:39.800 --> 21:41.140
You can't force them.

204
21:49.640 --> 21:51.041
Ye Ping Jun.

205
21:54.120 --> 21:55.826
What am I supposed to do with you?

206
22:31.160 --> 22:34.720
[Entry ID: 2, Feb 16th, Military Asset Transfer]

207
22:40.680 --> 22:43.073
[Entry ID: 2, Feb 24th, Military Asset Transfer]

208
22:51.920 --> 22:53.924
Secretary Jiang, what's taking so long?

209
22:53.924 --> 22:55.226
Are you done yet?

210
22:59.960 --> 23:01.160
Found it.

211
23:24.080 --> 23:26.080
How did I fall asleep?

212
23:28.000 --> 23:29.097
Where's Mu?

213
23:29.097 --> 23:31.419
I already took Mu back to the orphanage.

214
23:32.480 --> 23:37.680
I didn't expect you to sleep so soundly with me around.

215
23:39.080 --> 23:41.760
Don't you consider yourself a gentleman?

216
23:43.600 --> 23:46.979
When have I ever been one in your eyes?

217
24:05.600 --> 24:08.720
Thank you for taking me home. I'll head inside.

218
25:03.759 --> 25:05.066
Ye Ping Jun.

219
25:05.880 --> 25:07.201
Ping Jun.

220
25:12.320 --> 25:13.686
Xue Ting.

221
25:17.400 --> 25:18.777
Corps Commander.

222
25:18.777 --> 25:20.469
It's so late.

223
25:20.469 --> 25:22.853
Why did you bring Ping Jun home yourself?

224
25:34.760 --> 25:37.564
Ping Jun and I celebrated Mu's birthday.

225
25:37.564 --> 25:40.660
We went to the temple fair and made clay figurines.

226
25:45.720 --> 25:48.566
Zhang Ying Mei said you were working late.

227
25:48.566 --> 25:50.840
So Mu contacted Master Chang Xuan.

228
25:50.840 --> 25:53.200
That's how we ran into each other.

229
25:54.800 --> 25:56.626
You're so busy,

230
25:57.640 --> 25:59.384
yet you still brought her home.

231
25:59.384 --> 26:01.193
I'm sorry for the trouble.

232
26:02.520 --> 26:04.160
You're one of my people.

233
26:04.160 --> 26:07.580
So your girlfriend is also...

234
26:15.840 --> 26:17.280
a military family member.

235
26:20.120 --> 26:22.146
It's only right that I take good care of her.

236
26:23.840 --> 26:25.100
It's getting late.

237
26:25.746 --> 26:29.487
We won't invite you in for tea.

238
26:29.487 --> 26:32.747
No need to be so formal with me.

239
26:48.040 --> 26:49.673
Let's go inside.

240
27:14.579 --> 27:16.000
Good day, Corps Commander.

241
27:18.200 --> 27:19.520
Corps Commander.

242
27:20.400 --> 27:22.126
Could we speak in private?

243
27:27.280 --> 27:29.900
Whatever it is, just say it.

244
27:31.400 --> 27:36.178
First, thanks for celebrating Mu's birthday with Ping Jun in my place.

245
27:36.178 --> 27:38.039
I should have gone myself.

246
27:38.039 --> 27:42.006
But right before work ended, I suddenly got assigned overtime.

247
27:42.640 --> 27:45.600
As long as the kids were happy, don't worry about it.

248
27:45.600 --> 27:52.033
I just don't know if you really care about kids or if you have some other motive.

249
27:55.200 --> 27:57.613
I don't understand what you mean.

250
28:00.400 --> 28:02.360
I checked the assignment log.

251
28:02.360 --> 28:05.125
The carbine translation was supposed to be next week.

252
28:05.125 --> 28:06.924
I could have gone to the appointment.

253
28:08.019 --> 28:11.838
You must have arranged it on purpose to stop me from going.

254
28:14.280 --> 28:15.679
Am I wrong?

255
28:16.740 --> 28:18.079
So what if you are right?

256
28:26.640 --> 28:29.993
A real man competes openly and honestly.

257
28:29.993 --> 28:34.740
He doesn't scheme behind people's backs like a coward.

258
28:41.160 --> 28:43.393
How well do you really know Ye Ping Jun?

259
28:44.840 --> 28:46.704
You two grew up together.

260
28:46.704 --> 28:52.140
But is it love, or just dependence like family?

261
28:54.040 --> 28:55.720
Can you even tell the difference?

262
29:06.920 --> 29:08.660
That's between us.

263
29:09.480 --> 29:13.306
You should focus on your own fiancée.

264
29:28.360 --> 29:31.293
[Nanhuai Press]

265
29:31.293 --> 29:32.880
The military is strictly managed.

266
29:32.880 --> 29:34.480
Every military vehicle trip is recorded.

267
29:34.480 --> 29:35.920
But they can't be lent out privately.

268
29:35.920 --> 29:41.017
So I thought to check the vehicle records from the Xiping battlefield to the mines.

269
29:41.017 --> 29:46.290
They altered the destination, but the time, distance, and head count match.

270
29:46.290 --> 29:50.900
The order came from Feng San Li, commander of 4th Brigade, 2nd Corps.

271
29:53.059 --> 29:54.240
Excellent.

272
29:54.240 --> 29:55.320
Xue Ting.

273
29:55.320 --> 29:59.197
I'll arrange the typesetting and printing right away.

274
29:59.197 --> 30:01.613
We'll publish it secretly through the underground newspaper.

275
30:30.586 --> 30:31.600
Hello.

276
30:31.600 --> 30:33.937
Commander Mou. This is Hong Wen.

277
30:33.937 --> 30:36.320
The man I relied on in Japan

278
30:36.320 --> 30:40.070
has infiltrated the Yu Army and found solid evidence.

279
30:40.070 --> 30:43.546
He'll expose it under the pen name "Jun Guan".

280
30:43.546 --> 30:46.880
"Jun Guan" means a gentleman may die, but keeps his cap on.

281
30:48.200 --> 30:50.040
This man has great ambition.

282
30:50.040 --> 30:51.600
These days,

283
30:51.600 --> 30:56.480
young writers with fire in their blood are as powerful as machine guns and cannons.

284
30:56.480 --> 31:01.560
By tomorrow, this will be all over town.

285
31:01.560 --> 31:02.821
Good.

286
31:16.320 --> 31:18.600
Newspaper! Get your newspaper!

287
31:18.600 --> 31:20.319
- That's barbaric. - Get your newspaper!

288
31:20.319 --> 31:22.480
- What the hell is going on? - This is outrageous.

289
31:22.480 --> 31:24.880
- What hope is there now? - Is there any law left?

290
31:24.880 --> 31:26.960
The Yu Army forced soldiers to work as miners.

291
31:26.960 --> 31:29.560
50 soldiers died in a mining disaster.

292
31:29.560 --> 31:30.980
This is outrageous.

293
31:31.760 --> 31:33.767
50 lives were lost.

294
31:33.767 --> 31:38.039
[Sparks]

295
31:38.039 --> 31:39.960
The story has already spread everywhere.

296
31:39.960 --> 31:41.079
Exactly.

297
31:41.079 --> 31:43.180
- This is going to be difficult. - We need to find a way to bury it.

298
31:49.680 --> 31:51.126
Master Chang Xuan.

299
31:52.960 --> 31:54.913
The underground newspaper office has been burned down.

300
31:54.913 --> 31:56.400
But they only handled the printing.

301
31:56.400 --> 31:58.357
They knew nothing about the source.

302
31:58.357 --> 32:03.037
We compared the recovered manuscripts against the handwriting of clerks in the army.

303
32:03.037 --> 32:06.260
Still no leads connected to Jun Guan?

304
32:07.640 --> 32:09.440
Nothing so far.

305
32:10.880 --> 32:13.960
Put more men on it. I want answers as soon as possible.

306
32:13.960 --> 32:15.320
Understood.

307
32:15.320 --> 32:17.040
And the mine.

308
32:17.040 --> 32:20.185
It was registered as an iron mine, but it was actually a gold mine.

309
32:20.185 --> 32:24.905
By law, all locally mined gold must be turned over to the central government.

310
32:26.360 --> 32:28.966
They used soldiers' lives to hide this deal.

311
32:30.103 --> 32:31.779
They've got nerve.

312
32:33.080 --> 32:34.240
Who's in charge?

313
32:34.240 --> 32:35.444
His name is Liao Tie.

314
32:35.444 --> 32:37.760
He seems completely ordinary,

315
32:37.760 --> 32:40.400
but he's actually Feng San Li's distant nephew.

316
32:44.720 --> 32:46.480
Chang Xuan, about Feng San Li...

317
32:46.480 --> 32:47.880
Arrest him.

318
32:47.880 --> 32:48.959
Yes, sir.

319
32:50.653 --> 32:53.240
This is slander. Pure slander.

320
32:53.240 --> 32:58.059
I may have a temper, but I'm no coward.

321
32:58.059 --> 32:59.973
Gold mines, iron mines,

322
33:00.640 --> 33:02.640
or whatever mines don't have anything to do with me.

323
33:03.560 --> 33:05.040
Feng San Li.

324
33:06.360 --> 33:08.460
Don't waste the chance I've given you.

325
33:09.080 --> 33:13.080
All I have to say is this: I didn't do it.

326
33:16.480 --> 33:20.081
Soldiers from your barracks were taken onto military trucks.

327
33:21.400 --> 33:25.652
And the man in charge of the mine is your distant nephew.

328
33:25.652 --> 33:29.313
We also have handwritten wills from so many soldiers killed in the mines.

329
33:31.600 --> 33:33.766
How can you still deny it?

330
33:36.560 --> 33:42.686
You keep saying you were loyal to my father and the Yu Army.

331
33:43.920 --> 33:48.624
But everything you've done has pushed them straight into the line of fire.

332
33:48.624 --> 33:51.120
You put them all in mortal danger.

333
33:51.120 --> 33:53.660
Is that what you call loyalty?

334
33:55.960 --> 33:58.112
You say I embezzled the gold mine.

335
33:58.112 --> 33:59.920
But you catch a thief with the goods.

336
33:59.920 --> 34:01.253
Where are they?

337
34:01.960 --> 34:03.453
Do you have the stolen goods?

338
34:04.760 --> 34:08.120
I never personally ordered the use of military trucks.

339
34:08.120 --> 34:10.363
That was done by a distant nephew of mine.

340
34:10.363 --> 34:12.707
He's barely even family.

341
34:12.707 --> 34:16.331
Now that he's in trouble, he's trying to drag me down with him.

342
34:16.331 --> 34:18.800
Even if the central government asks,

343
34:18.800 --> 34:21.946
you can't jail me without evidence.

344
34:25.440 --> 34:27.039
Master Chang Xuan.

345
34:27.039 --> 34:28.480
Let me ask you this.

346
34:29.160 --> 34:32.600
Do you and Commander-in-Chief trust outsiders,

347
34:32.600 --> 34:35.840
or someone who has risked his life for the Yu Army?

348
34:35.840 --> 34:41.600
That's me! I still have 27 bullet holes in my body.

349
34:50.680 --> 34:52.317
Give us justice.

350
34:52.317 --> 34:54.019
- Give us justice. - Give us justice.

351
34:54.019 --> 34:55.560
Hand over the killer.

352
34:55.560 --> 34:57.280
- Hand over the killer. - Hand over the killer.

353
34:57.280 --> 34:58.900
[Arrest the culprit and give us justice] Give us justice.

354
34:58.900 --> 35:00.340
- Give us justice. - Give us justice.

355
35:00.340 --> 35:01.940
Hand over the killer.

356
35:01.940 --> 35:03.760
- Hand over the killer. - Hand over the killer.

357
35:03.760 --> 35:05.199
Hand over the killer.

358
35:05.199 --> 35:06.579
Give us justice.

359
35:06.579 --> 35:08.079
Give us justice.

360
35:08.079 --> 35:09.659
Hand him over.

361
35:09.659 --> 35:11.520
Hand over the killer.

362
35:12.120 --> 35:13.770
This is outrageous.

363
35:13.770 --> 35:16.400
All the blame is now pinned on Father and Chang Xuan.

364
35:16.400 --> 35:18.686
They're being portrayed as utterly unforgivable.

365
35:18.686 --> 35:22.770
Our wounded soldiers are treated at designated hospitals, free of charge.

366
35:22.770 --> 35:24.120
How could we possibly mistreat our soldiers?

367
35:24.120 --> 35:26.040
The Yu Army has tens of thousands of men.

368
35:26.040 --> 35:29.510
How could anyone claim there are no corrupt officers in the ranks?

369
35:29.510 --> 35:32.080
You have to trust your father and Chang Xuan.

370
35:32.080 --> 35:36.080
They'll soon find the bad apples.

371
35:36.960 --> 35:40.746
Mother, we can't just stay home and wait for Father and Chang Xuan to clear their names.

372
35:40.746 --> 35:42.555
I have an idea.

373
35:42.555 --> 35:46.000
The women in our family can visit the wounded at the military hospital.

374
35:46.000 --> 35:48.157
First, to steady the troops.

375
35:48.157 --> 35:50.080
If the Yu family truly mistreated soldiers,

376
35:50.080 --> 35:52.646
how could we face them with such confidence?

377
35:53.353 --> 35:55.960
Second, to set an example.

378
35:55.960 --> 35:59.596
We share our soldiers' honor and disgrace.

379
35:59.596 --> 36:01.760
We've never turned our backs on them.

380
36:01.760 --> 36:08.025
But what if people say we're just putting on a show?

381
36:08.025 --> 36:10.160
The truth will speak for itself.

382
36:10.160 --> 36:13.480
Our intent is simply to care for the wounded.

383
36:13.480 --> 36:15.600
Rumors don't matter.

384
36:15.600 --> 36:19.630
We did it before, and we'll keep doing it.

385
36:19.630 --> 36:24.811
Visiting the wounded together sets an example.

386
36:26.240 --> 36:27.760
Qi Xuan.

387
36:27.760 --> 36:29.480
I have a task for you.

388
36:29.480 --> 36:32.106
Yes, Mom. What is it?

389
36:32.106 --> 36:38.240
The Spring Wind Troupe was highly praised for aiding refugees.

390
36:38.240 --> 36:43.363
I want to invite Director Liang and Miss Ye to visit the hospital together.

391
36:43.363 --> 36:46.793
We can have them write a play to comfort the wounded.

392
36:47.926 --> 36:49.240
That's a great idea.

393
36:49.240 --> 36:51.720
I'll contact them right now.

394
36:51.720 --> 36:53.520
- Go ahead. - Sure.

395
36:55.760 --> 36:59.960
Feng San Li's distant nephew has taken all the blame.

396
36:59.960 --> 37:04.373
- Feng San Li is stubbornly denying everything. - Corps Commander, Advisor Li.

397
37:04.373 --> 37:06.720
Looks like he planned from the start to find a fall guy.

398
37:06.720 --> 37:07.984
Master Chang Xuan.

399
37:07.984 --> 37:09.206
Master Chang Xuan.

400
37:11.880 --> 37:13.820
The central government has sent an official telegram.

401
37:15.320 --> 37:18.090
An Army Inspector will come in person to inspect the Yu Army.

402
37:18.090 --> 37:22.130
They'll supervise military conduct until we catch those behind the mine disaster.

403
37:23.720 --> 37:27.120
Could Chu Wen Fu be using this chance to stab us in the back?

404
37:27.999 --> 37:30.880
After crossing Master Cheng, Chu Wen Fu kept a low profile.

405
37:30.880 --> 37:32.280
He hasn't made a move.

406
37:33.080 --> 37:35.099
The gold mine belongs to the central government.

407
37:35.099 --> 37:37.945
They'll naturally suspect the Yu Army of pocketing the gold.

408
37:37.945 --> 37:39.605
They'll investigate all the way.

409
37:40.560 --> 37:42.490
We really invited a royal pain in the neck.

410
37:42.490 --> 37:45.260
I'm telling you, they're using this chance to divide our military command.

411
37:48.040 --> 37:51.080
Finding that gold is our top priority.

412
37:51.080 --> 37:54.353
If there's gold, there has to be a place it's stored.

413
37:54.353 --> 37:57.920
No matter how carefully Feng San Li hid it,

414
37:57.920 --> 37:59.920
he must have left some trace.

415
38:00.960 --> 38:02.140
- Yes, sir. - Yes, sir.

416
38:14.840 --> 38:17.099
Come. Have some porridge.

417
38:18.780 --> 38:19.920
Careful.

418
38:19.920 --> 38:21.132
Okay.

419
38:21.132 --> 38:27.613
[Nanhuai Army Hospital]

420
38:35.673 --> 38:37.040
Careful, it's hot.

421
38:37.040 --> 38:38.380
Thanks, Madam.

422
38:40.000 --> 38:41.300
Auntie.

423
38:42.080 --> 38:44.200
Zi Yi, what brings you here?

424
38:44.200 --> 38:47.720
Auntie, I heard from Chang Xuan that you were coming to visit the wounded soldiers.

425
38:47.720 --> 38:50.526
I thought I could do my part.

426
38:50.526 --> 38:51.810
Auntie.

427
38:51.810 --> 38:53.800
Where is Chang Xuan?

428
38:53.800 --> 38:56.040
He's inside visiting the critically wounded.

429
38:56.040 --> 38:57.566
He'll be here soon.

430
38:59.280 --> 39:01.000
Be sure to follow your treatment plan.

431
39:01.000 --> 39:02.360
Thanks, Madam.

432
39:02.360 --> 39:04.280
- Let me hold that for you. - I don't need any help.

433
39:04.280 --> 39:05.360
I'm fine.

434
39:06.000 --> 39:07.120
Madam Yu.

435
39:07.120 --> 39:08.840
Ye Ping Jun?

436
39:08.840 --> 39:10.452
Why are you here?

437
39:10.452 --> 39:12.060
I invited them.

438
39:12.640 --> 39:15.160
Miss Ye. Director Liang.

439
39:15.160 --> 39:16.955
Miss Sun.

440
39:16.955 --> 39:20.360
Please help with this new production.

441
39:20.360 --> 39:22.040
You're too kind, Madam Yu.

442
39:22.040 --> 39:23.404
It's what we should do.

443
39:23.404 --> 39:24.800
It's our responsibility.

444
39:24.800 --> 39:26.644
We'll see it through.

445
39:26.644 --> 39:30.219
Okay. I won't keep you. Carry on.

446
39:30.219 --> 39:31.519
Then let's check the critical care ward.

447
39:31.519 --> 39:32.639
Okay.

448
39:34.519 --> 39:36.520
Auntie, I'll go take a look too.

449
39:36.520 --> 39:37.573
Go ahead.

450
39:44.800 --> 39:46.920
How long have you been out fighting?

451
39:46.920 --> 39:48.400
Over two years.

452
39:48.400 --> 39:51.080
Two years, I see. Have you been home?

453
39:51.080 --> 39:52.200
No.

454
39:56.440 --> 39:57.580
Give me the porridge.

455
40:07.600 --> 40:09.673
It's bird's nest porridge. Let me feed you.

456
40:18.480 --> 40:21.613
Miss Tao, apologies, but the patient needs a dressing change.

457
40:22.579 --> 40:23.579
I'll do it.

458
40:23.579 --> 40:24.579
Okay.

459
40:31.000 --> 40:32.426
I'll change your dressing.

460
40:49.680 --> 40:51.720
Calm down. I'll do it.

461
41:04.040 --> 41:05.580
This might sting a little.

462
41:14.280 --> 41:15.599
Here we go.

463
41:19.360 --> 41:20.486
All done.

464
41:21.360 --> 41:23.360
Let me tend to your arm.

465
41:38.480 --> 41:40.760
Get your commanding officer.

466
41:40.760 --> 41:42.444
- Go get your commanding officer. - Don't come any closer.

467
41:42.444 --> 41:43.980
You, put the knife down first.

468
41:43.980 --> 41:45.980
Get your commanding officer.

469
41:46.840 --> 41:48.124
Step back.

470
41:48.124 --> 41:50.193
Go get your commanding officer.

471
41:53.440 --> 41:55.233
Corps Commander, we have a situation.

472
41:56.019 --> 41:57.019
Get your commanding officer.

473
41:57.019 --> 41:58.079
Stay calm.

474
41:58.079 --> 41:59.840
- Let's talk this out. - Get your commanding officer over here.

475
41:59.840 --> 42:00.920
- Madam, look out! - Miss Ye.

476
42:00.920 --> 42:02.000
- Danger. - Auntie.

477
42:02.000 --> 42:04.606
Step back. I want to see your commanding officer.

478
42:04.606 --> 42:06.137
Let her go.

479
42:06.137 --> 42:07.740
Let her go.

480
42:07.740 --> 42:09.786
Put the gun down.

481
42:09.786 --> 42:11.560
I said put the gun down. Do you hear me?

482
42:11.560 --> 42:13.580
Or I'll kill her.

483
42:16.760 --> 42:18.059
Chang Xuan.

484
42:35.360 --> 42:36.440
Calm down.

485
42:37.400 --> 42:40.504
Tell me what's wrong. I'll help you fix it.

486
42:40.504 --> 42:43.553
Can you give me my leg back?

487
42:43.553 --> 42:48.440
They promised me army pay and proper treatment for my leg.

488
42:49.120 --> 42:50.920
I begged them over and over,

489
42:50.920 --> 42:53.520
but I never saw a cent.

490
42:53.520 --> 42:57.680
And now? My leg is ruined.

491
42:57.680 --> 43:00.040
How am I supposed to get through the rest of my life?

492
43:00.040 --> 43:03.019
How am I supposed to live now? Tell me.

493
43:03.019 --> 43:08.480
I will look into everything you said and give you an answer.

494
43:08.480 --> 43:10.200
Who would believe your lies?

495
43:10.200 --> 43:13.240
Everyone out there is talking about it.

496
43:13.240 --> 43:16.760
The Yu Army forced soldiers to work as miners.

497
43:16.760 --> 43:21.120
50 lives were lost for nothing.

498
43:21.120 --> 43:26.290
You only claim you love the people like your own children.

499
43:26.290 --> 43:29.046
But behind our backs, you don't treat us like people at all.

500
43:31.760 --> 43:34.040
Whatever grievance you have,

501
43:34.040 --> 43:36.078
this girl has nothing to do with it.

502
43:36.078 --> 43:37.152
Let her go.

503
43:37.960 --> 43:39.033
Take me instead.

504
43:47.200 --> 43:48.939
Why should I trust you?

505
43:49.720 --> 43:53.200
I'm Yu Chang Xuan, Commander of the 9th Corps.

506
43:53.200 --> 43:57.533
Since the mining disaster came to light, I've been investigating it.

507
43:58.280 --> 44:03.176
I owe an answer not just to those 50 soldiers, but to every soldier.

508
44:03.176 --> 44:05.720
This girl treated you out of kindness.

509
44:05.720 --> 44:07.200
You shouldn't hurt her.

510
44:07.200 --> 44:11.440
I will answer for everything that happens in the army.

511
44:11.440 --> 44:13.640
You're Master Chang Xuan.

512
44:13.640 --> 44:14.960
I know who you are.

513
44:14.960 --> 44:19.201
You've arrested plenty of corrupt men in the army.

514
44:20.440 --> 44:21.860
You can trust me.

515
44:23.219 --> 44:24.219
Come on.

516
44:36.720 --> 44:37.919
Chang Xuan.

517
44:39.400 --> 44:40.633
Chang Xuan
